ed legendary mercenary units passing through during her formative years. Despite the city\'s fear-inducing MechWarrior games, Rayan aspired to pilot a \'Mech and forge her own fearsome legacy. After her uncle\'s fatal injury, she stowed away on a mercenary unit\'s transport to Solaris, where she, despite her age, competed and excelled. Piloting a new \'Mech, \"The Indomitable,\" Rayan achieved an unprecedented winning streak, but accusations of fixed matches led to a gauntlet match and a career-ending blow. Retiring to Galatea, she embraced her roots, enduring a wheelchair-bound life without condemning the violence that marked her MechWarrior days."),SelectedWeaponHardPoints=("Torso_Left_MH1_srm4","Torso_Right_BH1_heavyrifle","Upperarm_Right_MH1_srm4","Forearm_Right_BH1_heavyrifle","Upperarm_Left_MH1_srm4","Forearm_Left_BH1_heavyrifle","Arm_Left_LowerArm_Actuator_Melee","Arm_Right_LowerArm_Actuator_Melee"),BlankWeaponHardPoints=("Centre_Center_BLANK_blank","Head_Bolton_Blank"),bRecalculateFreeSlotsOnSave=True,EquipmentAllocation=(ArmorDataAssetId=(Id="MWArmorDataAsset:StandardArmor"),StructureDataAssetId=(Id="MWStructureDataAsset:EndoSteelStructure"),AllowedHeatSinkType=(TagName="Equipment.HeatSinks.Double"),SlotData=((SlotTypeDataAssetId=(Id="MWSlotTypeDataAsset:General_SlotType"),SlotCounts=((Head, 1),(CenterTorso, 2),(LeftTorso, 8),(LeftArm, 4),(LeftLeg, 2),(RightTorso, 5),(RightArm, 4),(RightLeg, 2))),(SlotTypeDataAssetId=(Id="MWSlotTypeDataAsset:EngineHeatsink_SlotType"),SlotCounts=((CenterTorso, 1)))),InternalEquipment=(LifeSupport,Sensors,Cockpit,Gyro,LeftArm_Shoulder,LeftArm_UpperActuator,RightArm_Shoulder,RightArm_UpperActuator,LeftLeg_Hip,LeftLeg_UpperActuator,LeftLeg_LowerActuator,LeftLeg_FootActuator,RightLeg_Hip,RightLeg_UpperActuator,RightLeg_LowerActuator,RightLeg_FootActuator),OtherCompatibilities=(KelMechEquipmentCompatibilityFunction_TechBase'"KelMechEquipmentCompatibilityFunction_TechBase_1"'),TotalTraitSlots=8),RefitCosts=(Id="MWMechRefitCostsDat